{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-30","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：不可公度量与可公度量与平方","englishTitle":"To find two rational straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater is greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with the greater.","book":10,"number":30,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.30","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.30/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":30,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","contentId":"euclid-10-30","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"851ebe9deb951ec7e65a3db1391966e5dc3caba0cb6406354affd67b0f1feefd","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-30.statement","euclid-10-30.construction.1","euclid-10-30.proof.1","euclid-10-30.proof.2","euclid-10-30.proof.3","euclid-10-30.proof.4","euclid-10-30.conclusion","euclid-10-30.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-30.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d9b7488746a8d6c6e4bf5f2adaf4189857e4cf20c4b41a3aef48f8258463e8d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two rational straight lines commensurable in square only and such that the square on the greater is greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"发现两枚有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度型,较大数量上正方形型,比较大数量直线不可公度型正方形型小号正方形型大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f11928e71b8f6816a7f5c6fabd1f5b2cd84a30b4f5ecb488935e84f60a8f0713","citations":["euclid-10-28","euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out a rational straight line AB, and two square numbers CE, ED such that their sum CD is not square; [[Lemma 2](/principles/euclid-10-28)] let there be described on AB the semicircle AFB, let it be contrived that, as DC is to CE, so is the square on BA to the square on AF, [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] and let FB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨列出有理线段 AB和2 平方数 CE,ED, 其总数CD不是正方形;请在AB描述AFB半圆圈,以图DC-CE的比例等于BA和正方形的比例,AF和FB之间连接 [[引理 2](/principles/euclid-10-28)] [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6511a1a940e3f6b4f92114ef35fb87f2f7f40aaa748ea161134e598a5dca6d58","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, in a similar manner to the preceding, we can prove that BA, AF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,以与前文相似的方式,我们可以证明BA,AF是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b76c12ca3cf38f22d08f9d5c9a6de80098c2bcf8209cc5eb7aab253c57a7367","citations":["euclid-5-19","euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as DC is to CE, so is the square on BA to the square on AF, therefore, convertendo, as CD is to DE, so is the square on AB to the square on BF. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19), [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31), [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC比CE等于BA比正方形,AF,CD比DE,AB比正方形,BF比正方形 [ [V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19) [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83edbc34ca774052823ff826bd957bd87f85759aeb8902e99d4b345c47dd8f6b","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD has not to DE the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on AB to the square on BF the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore AB is incommensurable in length with BF. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CD的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,BF的比例为正方形,而AB的比例为正方形,而BF的比例为平方数;因此,AB的比例为不可公度,而BF的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：DE） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9291dbd2455a31721bb5f19df8f69567440865a6b1b4bfdcefb6b2b00493d0a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on AB is greater than the square on AF by the square on FB incommensurable with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB的正方形比AF的正方形还要高 FB不可公度AB正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc1bdd854c8bec7b09ee7d61ad6e08ebf27e10b5a1d92d082ea0dd9ac6140f1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB, AF are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, and the square on AB is greater than the square on AF by the square on FB incommensurable in length with AB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB,AF是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AB的正方形比AF的正方形比FB 不可公度长的正方形还要多,AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-30.source","contentId":"euclid-10-30","revisionId":"euclid-10-30@raw-851ebe9deb951ec7","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4c659c452d8e91ed877c66dd02b50f1d3c4ca0c9ae111e31d3a0d69f07d691d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.30/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.30\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-30:euclid-10-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-30","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-30.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sou